<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '20px 72px', flexDirection: 'column', background: 'linear-gradient(160deg, #0B1220 0%, #16233D 100%)', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC", "Noto Sans SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>
    {/* A 区 · 标题块 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'flex-start', paddingTop: 6 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 36, background: '#2AD4EE', marginTop: 5 }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF9' }}>Agent = LLM + 工具 + 记忆 + 规划</Text>
            <Text style={{ marginTop: 8, fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.52)' }}>让模型从「只会聊天」变成「能干活、会决策、可循环」的程序</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* B 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 516, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        {/* 巨型公式 */}
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16, paddingTop: 8, paddingBottom: 24, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(232,238,249,0.12)' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 72, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2AD4EE', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace', lineHeight: 1 }}>Agent</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.42)', marginLeft: 8, marginRight: 8 }}>=</Text>
            {['LLM', '工具', '记忆', '规划'].map((t, i) => (
                <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
                    {i > 0 && <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.42)' }}>+</Text>}
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF9', lineHeight: 1 }}>{t}</Text>
                </Box>
            ))}
        </Box>

        {/* 四要素说明 */}
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 22 }}>
            {[
                { t: '大脑', d: '无状态的推理引擎。它决定「下一步该干什么」，但自己不记得任何事。' },
                { t: '手脚', d: '你写的普通函数。模型只能「说要调用哪个」，执行权始终在你手里。' },
                { t: '上下文', d: '短期靠 messages，长期靠向量库。近期带原文，远期压摘要。' },
                { t: '循环', d: '简单任务单循环就够，复杂任务先拆步骤。别一上来就过度设计。' },
            ].map((c, i) => (
                <Box key={i} style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: i === 0 ? 0 : 24, paddingRight: i === 3 ? 0 : 24, borderRight: i === 3 ? 'none' : '1px solid rgba(232,238,249,0.10)' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 2, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>0{i + 1} {c.t}</Text>
                    <Text style={{ marginTop: 12, fontSize: 22, fontWeight: '600', color: '#E8EEF9' }}>{['LLM', '工具', '记忆', '规划'][i]}</Text>
                    <Text style={{ marginTop: 10, fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.66)', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>{c.d}</Text>
                </Box>
            ))}
        </Box>

        {/* 判断 */}
        <Box style={{ height: 62, marginTop: 16, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, background: 'rgba(42,212,238,0.08)', border: '1px solid rgba(42,212,238,0.22)', borderRadius: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#2AD4EE', fontWeight: 'bold', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>所以</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 28, background: 'rgba(42,212,238,0.35)' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E8EEF9', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                四要素缺任何一项，它都只是一个<span style={{ color: '#2AD4EE' }}>会聊天的模型</span>——而不是一个能自己把活干完的程序。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* C 区 · 页脚 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.42)' }}>从 LLM 到 Agent 再到 Pi Agent</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.42)', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>12 / 37</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
